OL,3,GNEWSAThree-year ban on fires and BBQs
OL,4,Ain parks approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA three-year ban on fires, barbecues
OL,7,Fand fireworks in many of a city's parks
OL,8,Fand open spaces is being introduced.
OL,10,FOxford City Council has approved the
OL,11,Fintroduction of the new Public Space
OL,12,FProtection Order (PSPO), which it says
OL,13,Fis "needed to reduce the risk of
OL,14,Fwildfires".
OL,16,FIt follows what was declared by the Met
OL,17,FOffice earlier this week as the UK's
OL,18,Fhottest summer on record, with the dry
OL,19,Fweather leading to wildfires across the
OL,20,Fcountry.
