OL,3,GNEWSAThree-year ban on fires and BBQs
OL,4,Ain parks approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new rules mean that from Friday,
OL,7,Fthose who light open fires or use
OL,8,Fbarbecues, lanterns or fireworks at one
OL,9,Fof 41 sites across the city could face
OL,10,Ffines.
